<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Document</title>

    <script  src="https://code.jquery.com/jquery-4.0.0.js"></script>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .faq-container {
            width: 500px;
            
        }
        .faq-question {
            background-color: #f2f2f2;
            padding: 10px;
            cursor: pointer;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            margin-top: 5px;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }
        .faq-answer {
            display: none;
            padding: 10px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-top: none;
            background-color: #fafafa;
        }

        /* Highlight class */
        .active {
            background-color: #007bff;
            color: white;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
    </style>

</head>
<body>
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="faq-container">
        
        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">1.What courses do you offer?</div>
            <div class="faq-answer">We offer Wb Development, Data Science, AI/ML Courses etc.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">2. What is the course duration?</div>
            <div class="faq-answer"> 3 to 6 months.</div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">3. Do you provide certificates?</div>
            <div class="faq-answer">Yes, we provide certification after successful completion.</div>
        </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question">4. Are classes live or recorded?</div>
        <div class="faq-answer">We provide both live and recorded.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question">5. Is placement support available?</div>
        <div class="faq-answer">Yes, we provide placement assistance and interview guidance.</div>
    </div>

    </div>

        <script>
            $(document).ready(function(){
                $(".faq-question").click(function(){
                   // Toggle currnt ans
                   $(this).next(".faq-answer").slideToggle(2000);
                   // Toggle highlight 
                   $(this).toggleClass("active");
                   

                });
            });
        </script>

</body>
</html>
